Every time your shield loses 25% of its original value a circle of desolate waste will spawn under you, lasting 6 turns, and dealing [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; SP 100)] cold damage per turn to foes within radius [3, 4, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)].

If a creature is hit by your hiemal shield's retribution bolt while on the waste, the shield feeds of the wasteland to regenerate [2.0%, 3.0%, 3.8%, 4.4%, 5.0% (TL1-5)] of its original value.

No more than 4 desolate wastes can trigger per shield activation.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
